 htop,
 dfu-util
Description: PiCompose base system
 The compose manager of PiCompose, the PipeWire audio setup for the Linux
 voice assistant and the hostname setup of the PiCompose image.
 .
 The compose manager deploys every Docker Compose project below /compose
 at boot and on a schedule. Docker itself is not part of this package, the
 PiCompose image installs it from the Docker apt repository.
